            "message": "fix(cookie): measure whole chunks and reject a code point that cannot fit\n\nPer-character lengths are not additive for every custom `encode` (e.g.\nbase64), so bisect on the encoded length of the whole candidate chunk.\nA single code point whose encoding exceeds `chunkMaxLength` now throws\ninstead of emitting an oversized chunk.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
